                                "sense_id": "b07190db-44d8-3287-8726-36c8f70b5908",
                                "text": "Despite the somber mood prevailing in most of the city, Carnegie Hall last night was aburst with sound, light and color as a rock ’n’ roll “circus” attracted about 2,000 listeners."
                            },
