                                "sense_id": "b07190db-44d8-3287-8726-36c8f70b5908",
                                "text": "On the teak table stood two slender-necked blue vases Cohn had recently potted out of some rare lumps of clay, aburst with white fruit-tree blossoms he had painted on them."
